{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cThis place cannot be explained with logic. Record. Survive.\u201d</h2>Become a test subject for Async Corp. (hereafter Backroom Company) and explore the unknown space hidden behind the Noclip phenomenon: the \u201cBackrooms.\u201d<br>Your mission is simple. Capture anomalous phenomena and transmit the data while staying alive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.poster.avif?t=1765500475\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.webm?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.mp4?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Official Release on July 30, 2025: Go Deeper</strong><br>Your exploration now goes beyond the hotel, swimming pool, and parking lot\u2014into the foul-smelling \u201cSewers\u201d and the eerie \u201cSchool.\u201d<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u>Exploration Mode</u>: Face the fear of getting lost in ever-changing environments.<br></li><li><u>Story Mode</u>: Follow a fixed map and uncover the massive conspiracy Backroom Company has been hiding.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.poster.avif?t=1765500475\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.webm?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.mp4?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Core Gameplay: Filming Is Survival</strong><br>Collect strange items scattered throughout the rooms and record unidentified entities to leave evidence.<br>The data you capture becomes your survival score\u2014and your key to escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84cd.poster.avif?t=1765500475\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84cd.webm?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84cd.mp4?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/3a0f7b5cc5e866b624f3cff08b039af1.poster.avif?t=1765500475\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/3a0f7b5cc5e866b624f3cff08b039af1.webm?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/3a0f7b5cc5e866b624f3cff08b039af1.mp4?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>\u201cHide or Stay Silent\u201d</strong><br>The beings of the Backrooms do not welcome you.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An immortal entity relentlessly chases you. The locker room is your only safe haven.<br></li><li>A monster without eyes detects even the faintest breath. Muffle your footsteps and hold your breath.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\