2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf89 <strong>Join Our Official Discord for Exclusive Perks!</strong> \ud83c\udf89</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Special Rewards</strong> \u2013 Only for our Discord members! <br>\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Direct Access to Developers</strong> \u2013 Get quick feedback and updates! <br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Connect with Global Players</strong> \u2013 Find your perfect party worldwide! <br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Explore the Backrooms Together</strong> \u2013 Team up with new friends for thrilling adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/bfc7ad4f0fbc6477b8b7c52ea37858c1.avif?t=1765500475\" width=276 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t miss out on these community-only perks! Join the fun and become part of the Backroom Company family today! \ud83d\udc7e\ud83d\udcac</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cThis place cannot be explained with logic. Record. Survive.\u201d</h2>Become a test subject for Async Corp. (hereafter Backroom Company) and explore the unknown space hidden behind the Noclip phenomenon: the \u201cBackrooms.\u201d<br>Your mission is simple. Capture anomalous phenomena and transmit the data while staying alive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.poster.avif?t=1765500475\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.webm?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.mp4?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Official Release on July 30, 2025: Go Deeper</strong><br>Your exploration now goes beyond the hotel, swimming pool, and parking lot\u2014into the foul-smelling \u201cSewers\u201d and the eerie \u201cSchool.\u201d<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u>Exploration Mode</u>: Face the fear of getting lost in ever-changing environments.<br></li><li><u>Story Mode</u>: Follow a fixed map and uncover the massive conspiracy Backroom Company has been hiding.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.poster.avif?t=1765500475\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.webm?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.mp4?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Core Gameplay: Filming Is Survival</strong><br>Collect strange items scattered throughout the rooms and record unidentified entities to leave evidence.<br>The data you capture becomes your survival score\u2014and your key to escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84cd.poster.avif?t=1765500475\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84cd.webm?t=1765500475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84